     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"#0563C1\" vlink=\"#954F72\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Colleagues,<span> </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">I want to inform you that new versions of RRPP (0.6.0) and of geomorph (3.3.0) are now on CRAN.  These include some new functions, as well as some minor bug fixes; all of which are described in the News and help files. There are also new\r\n vignettes, which we hope are informative.<span> </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Best,<span> </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br>\r\nDean, Mike, and Antigoni (your geomorph team)<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">Dr. Dean C. Adams<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">Director of Graduate Education, EEB Program<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">Professor<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">Department of Ecology, Evolution, and Organismal Biology<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">Iowa State University<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\"><a href=\"https://www.eeob.iastate.edu/faculty/adams/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.eeob.iastate.edu/faculty/adams/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792484478734000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2wC4CIkyrUDCwecsaRf4-3\"><span style=\"color:blue\">https://www.eeob.iastate.edu/faculty/adams/</span></a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">phone: <a href=\"tel:(515)%20294-3834\" value=\"+15152943834\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">515-294-3834</a><u></u><u></u></span></p>